<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-[28px] font-extrabold text-navy tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4">Why the price isn't fixed online</h2>
<p class="text-muted text-[15.5px] leading-[1.85] mb-5">
    Pane count, floor height, and how much sand and salt build-up has actually accumulated all move the number more than most people expect — two similarly sized homes a few streets apart can need very different amounts of work depending on how exposed they are to the wind. We confirm the exact pane count and access requirements during a free walkthrough, so the price you're quoted is the price you pay.
</p>

